If You materially violate this Licence, the permissions granted under it terminate to the extent permitted by law. The Licensor may notify You of a violation and permit correction, but no automatic cure period is promised unless required by law or a separate agreement.

Termination does not retroactively cancel valid rights held by unrelated end users under their own licences or override rights already granted by a different applicable licence. Sections concerning ownership, notices, disclaimers, limitations, and provisions that by their nature should survive continue as legally appropriate.

